  DATA : R_BAGIAN TYPE RANGE OF ZTLOG_TIMBANG-BAGIAN,
         W_RBAGIAN LIKE LINE OF R_BAGIAN.

INITIALIZATION.
  REFRESH R_BAGIAN.

  CLEAR W_RBAGIAN.
  W_RBAGIAN-SIGN   = 'I'.
  W_RBAGIAN-OPTION = 'EQ'.
  W_RBAGIAN-LOW    = 'SLT'.
  APPEND W_RBAGIAN TO R_BAGIAN.

  CLEAR W_RBAGIAN.
  W_RBAGIAN-SIGN   = 'I'.
  W_RBAGIAN-OPTION = 'EQ'.
  W_RBAGIAN-LOW    = 'PRS'.
  APPEND W_RBAGIAN TO R_BAGIAN.

  CLEAR W_RBAGIAN.
  W_RBAGIAN-SIGN   = 'I'.
  W_RBAGIAN-OPTION = 'EQ'.
  W_RBAGIAN-LOW    = 'RCL'.
  APPEND W_RBAGIAN TO R_BAGIAN.

  CLEAR W_RBAGIAN.
  W_RBAGIAN-SIGN   = 'I'.
  W_RBAGIAN-OPTION = 'EQ'.
  W_RBAGIAN-LOW    = 'OTH'.
  APPEND W_RBAGIAN TO R_BAGIAN.

  CLEAR W_RBAGIAN.
  W_RBAGIAN-SIGN   = 'I'.
  W_RBAGIAN-OPTION = 'EQ'.
  W_RBAGIAN-LOW    = 'RND'.
  APPEND W_RBAGIAN TO R_BAGIAN.

  CLEAR W_RBAGIAN.
  W_RBAGIAN-SIGN   = 'I'.
  W_RBAGIAN-OPTION = 'EQ'.
  W_RBAGIAN-LOW    = 'GUD'.
  APPEND W_RBAGIAN TO R_BAGIAN.